{"availability":"available","full":"Joangeldelarosa/pxlkit","name":"pxlkit","description":"Free to Use Retro React UI kit & pixel art icon library. Includes 40+ React components, 200+ hand-crafted SVG pixel icons (static & animated), and a visual builder. Built with TypeScript & Next.js.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":118,"forks":1,"created":"2026-03-11T00:18:26Z","updated":"2026-10-07T14:56:47Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://pxlkit.xyz/","topics":["components","design-system","frontend","react","ui"],"demo":"https://pxlkit.xyz/explore","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:43.394Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:43.394Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:43.394Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:51:43.394Z","stars":118,"forks":1}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Bring retro aesthetics to the modern web with React — and, new in 2.2, with Vue and Angular.","Pxlkit is a retro pixel-art UI kit for React: 111 components, 226+ pixel-art SVG icons in 7 themed packs, animated and 3D parallax icons, toast notifications, a visual icon builder and 6 page templates. New in 2.2: the same kit and icon components for Vue 3 and Angular, checked against React by parity tests.","Pxlkit.xyz is a monorepo containing a retro UI kit of 111 components for React — now also for Vue and Angular — 226+ pixel art icons organized into 7 themed packs, a framework-agnostic rendering engine with React, Vue and Angular icon components, a 3D voxel toolkit in early preview (its procedural world engine runs live at /explore), and a Next.js 15 showcase website. Every icon is a 16×16 character grid mapped to a color palette — designed to be hand-editable, AI-generatable, and version-control friendly. Browse and visually edit them at the official website."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Joangeldelarosa/pxlkit/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"4fba7366112e8ad06d09